  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"README.md"),"\nSports: Dashball includes Soccer, Basketball, Wrap Around Basketball, Target Break, Golden Rush, Gravity Flip Soccer and Boulder Control. Boulder Control is Battle-only: control the heavy boulder in your own zone for 1 point/s or 2 above the platform. Blue left, Red right, wrapping sides, first to 100. Size and Weight are in Boulder Settings. Punch the Gravity Flip Soccer switch to reverse gravity; its smaller goals travel between floor and ceiling and remain live in transit. Sandbag Showdown includes Damage Race, Damage Brawl and Sandbag Scramble. PvP sports default to 50% health, 15-second respawns (10/15/20 choices), and two-second protection ending on offense. Local sports support 1v1-5v5; private online remains 1v1. Soccer samples and Seeker sheets are embedded for offline file play.\n");
