  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"CREDITS.txt"),"\nSoccer UI SFX Pack (FREE LITE): supplied by the project owner; three trimmed mono cues. No separate license text was included in the supplied ZIP.\nBasketball sprite: supplied by the project owner. Chungus arm and Sandbag art: project-generated assets.\n");
  if(Object.keys(sportsScenery).length)fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"CREDITS.txt"),"\nSports scenery: owner-supplied CraftPix Free Sky with Clouds, Free Ancient Temple and Free Castle Interior packs. Original PNGs are used only as in-game scenery. Sources and freebie license notes are retained in assets/stages/sports/NOTICES.md and LICENSE.txt.\n");
  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"CREDITS.txt"),"Boulder Control sprite: generated for Dash Punch using the built-in image generation tool, exported as a 180-pixel, 16-color transparent sprite. No additional asset pack is required.\n");
  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"README.md"),"\nGravity Flip Boulder Control is also in the Dashball stage picker: Battle-only, first to 100. Punch the central switch to reverse shared gravity without changing momentum. Both bounded scoring windows, their bonus platforms and the neutral perch move continuously; scoring remains live during transit. The bonus side is away from current gravity. No new artwork, controls or fighter abilities.\n");
  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"README.md"),"\nTotal Rush: Battle-only, first to 300. Balanced defaults: control the boulder for 0.5/1 points per second, score three small balls through 5/10-point rings, or defeat the 144-HP snitch for 30 points. Snitch respawn: 45 seconds. KOs grant no points. Local 1v1-5v5 and private online 1v1. Team Outlines and Team Glow are local, automatically saved Settings options, on by default.\n");
  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"README.md"),"\nField Goal: Court or Battle, local 1v1-5v5 and private online 1v1. Loft the soccer ball above physical football uprights, then cross the elevated vertical scoring plane from midfield. Full-ball clearance earns one point. Posts/crossbars ricochet shots; small solid defensive perches give existing fighters a route up. Uses normal Soccer ball, clock, score target, celebration and resets. No gravity switch.\n");
  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"README.md"),"\nTotal Rush balance update: choose Total Rush, then Total Rush Settings. Balanced uses 0.5 territory / 1 bonus points per second total; Original restores 1 / 2. Both retain 5/10 rings, 30-point golden target, 144 HP, 45-second golden respawn and three small balls. Adjust any objective with its existing minus/plus controls to enter Custom. Zero-point objectives stay active; all-zero scoring cannot start. Scroll to Match Rules for the unchanged score target, timer, fighter respawn, health and team size. Settings synchronize from the host and persist on rematch.\n");
  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"README.md"),"\nOpen Arena Soccer: Soccer and Gravity Flip Soccer each have an adjacent Open Arena stage, with wrapping sides and a genuinely open top. Camera stays fixed and upright; top-edge indicators show high fighters and the ball. Normal downward gravity returns objects ballistically. Inverted gravity returns fully escaped objects from Y=-2400 into clear upper air, preserving velocity and resources, with a non-contact return step. Existing goals, Court/Battle, timers, local 5v5 and private online 1v1 remain. This source has no distinct Gravity Soccer sport; it is the Gravity Flip Soccer HUD shorthand, not a third gravity system.\n");
  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"README.md"),"\nBoomerangus is core fighter #14: an extremely slow armored heavyweight with one returning boomerang. Punch throws it; catch restores the weapon. Shield remains available while it is away, but release cannot queue another throw. Reflection transfers control and homing, while the original fighter remains limited to the same single weapon. Eight-second flight failsafe, shorter after reflections. Local 1-10 fighters and private online 1v1.\n");
  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"CREDITS.txt"),"Boomerangus: built-in image-generation edits of the project's Chungus/Seeker-derived art, with separate armed/unarmed 52-pixel pose cells and 16 baked weapon rotations. Functional pixel approximation; original Chungus art is unchanged. Same underlying Seeker project license applies.\n");
