  fs.appendFileSync(path.join(output,"README.md"),"\nSports refinements: KO gravestones are character-sized and remain at the knockout position until respawn. Field Goal now scores lateral crossings above a 3.4-Chungus-height crossbar, without needing a downward basket entry. The clock decides victory; goals replace only the scored ball with a fresh top drop, without stopping players or resetting respawns. Boulder body contact never accelerates the boulder. A moving boulder flattens grounded fighters for 0.85 seconds, or deals 8-18 damage and launches airborne fighters. Directional shields, active dashes and successful strikes defend. Chungus/Boomerangus use 46-cell pixel grids (formerly 52); the boomerang uses 28 pixels per 32-pixel frame, with original artwork and timing retained.\n");
